@page "/about"
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About"; }

<section class="about-hero">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">✦ THE MIKKY BLOOM STORYBOOK</p>
    <h1>Good things.<br />Thoughtfully <em>connected.</em></h1>
    <p>A welcoming 3D wholesale universe crafted for the people who keep neighborhood shelves stocked. Browse with confidence, order with clarity, and experience commerce designed with heart.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="primary" asp-page="/Catalog">Explore the collection ↗</a>
      <button class="outline" type="button" data-open-assistant>Meet Nova in 3D ✦</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="nova-scene">
    <span class="orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="orbit orbit-three" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <img src="/media/nova-3d-v2.webp" alt="Nova waving with a harvest box of groceries" width="1200" height="1334" />
    <span class="scene-label">Mikky Bloom 3D Edition · Nova Guide</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Mikky Bloom Philosophy Manifesto -->
<section class="story-editorial" data-reveal>
  <span class="launch-pill">✦ PHILOSOPHY & INSPIRATION</span>
  <h2>Warmth over cold chrome.<br />Joyful clay over sterile grids.</h2>
  <p class="editorial-lead">In the world of B2B wholesale, software is often gray, rigid, and tedious. <strong>Mikky Bloom</strong> re-imagined Northstar as a warm, tactile miniature universe where everyday pantry staples, friendly delivery vans, and helpful guides turn wholesale inventory into an experience of pure delight.</p>
  <p>Every product card, button click, and status tag is designed to celebrate the dedication of shop owners, grocers, and warehouse partners who keep life moving forward every single morning.</p>
</section>

<!-- Character & World Lore -->
<section class="universe-grid" data-reveal>
  <article class="universe-card universe-nova">
    <div class="universe-art">
      <img src="/media/nova-3d-v2.webp" alt="Nova character portrait" loading="lazy" />
      <span class="universe-tag">LEAD COMPANION</span>
    </div>
    <div class="universe-body">
      <h3>Meet Nova</h3>
      <p>Sculpted with a gentle mint ceramic shell and bright, curious eyes, Nova is Northstar's 3D animated companion. Built on local semantic retrieval, Nova can answer price questions, stock inquiries, or check past invoices in seconds.</p>
      <div class="character-stats">
        <span><b>Role:</b> 3D Concierge</span>
        <span><b>Personality:</b> Joyful & Attentive</span>
        <span><b>Favorite item:</b> Arabica Coffee</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="universe-card universe-truck">
    <div class="universe-art">
      <img src="/media/northstar-3d-hero.png" alt="Mint delivery truck" loading="lazy" />
      <span class="universe-tag">THE FLEET</span>
    </div>
    <div class="universe-body">
      <h3>The Mint Delivery Van</h3>
      <p>The cheerful rolling heartbeat of Northstar. Designed in soft clay geometry with warm headlights and rounded wheels, our fleet connects central warehouses directly to storefront doors without friction or lost packages.</p>
      <div class="character-stats">
        <span><b>Capacity:</b> Multi-item pallets</span>
        <span><b>Eco-spec:</b> All-electric transit</span>
        <span><b>Motto:</b> Always on time, with a smile</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<!-- Mikky Bloom Core Principles -->
<section class="value-cards" aria-label="Mikky Bloom Design Pillars" data-reveal>
  <article>
    <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌱</span>
    <h3>1. Radical Clarity</h3>
    <p>No mystery pricing, hidden fees, or opaque terms. See pack weights, unit prices in VND, and live inventory count before you ever build an order.</p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">📦</span>
    <h3>2. Unified Flow</h3>
    <p>Multiple categories — roasted Arabica, organic green teas, fragrant jasmine rice, and sun-dried cashews — combine into a single, cohesive checkout order.</p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
    <h3>3. Tactile 4K Motion</h3>
    <p>From the 30-second promotional film to smooth 60fps micro-interactions, every motion is tuned for smooth hardware performance and visual harmony.</p>
  </article>
</section>

<!-- Mikky Bloom Design System Palette & Tokens -->
<section class="design-tokens-section" data-reveal>
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">MIKKY BLOOM VISUAL LANGUAGE</p>
      <h2>Curated Color Harmony & Clay Tokens</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="soft-link">Designed for 4K Sharpness ✦</span>
  </div>
  <div class="token-swatches">
    <div class="swatch-card swatch-mint">
      <div class="swatch-color"></div>
      <strong>Mint Green</strong>
      <small>#24715D · Forest & Life</small>
    </div>
    <div class="swatch-card swatch-peach">
      <div class="swatch-color"></div>
      <strong>Peach Clay</strong>
      <small>#FFF4E6 · Warm Background</small>
    </div>
    <div class="swatch-card swatch-butter">
      <div class="swatch-color"></div>
      <strong>Butter Glow</strong>
      <small>#F9E9BC · Joyful Accents</small>
    </div>
    <div class="swatch-card swatch-lilac">
      <div class="swatch-color"></div>
      <strong>Cotton Lilac</strong>
      <small>#F2EAFE · Whimsical Sky</small>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The 30s Film Making-Of -->
<section class="film-story-card" data-reveal>
  <div class="film-story-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE MOTION</span>
    <h2>The 30-Second Commercial & 4K Animation</h2>
    <p>The animated showcase inside the hero was rendered using custom compositing pipelines, multi-layer alpha transitions, and Lanczos interpolation to achieve crisp 4K fidelity.</p>
    <p>Characters, floating pantry items, and dynamic captions follow a precise 30-second story rhythm that introduces partners to the ease of modern ordering.</p>
    <div class="film-actions">
      <a class="primary" href="/media/northstar-story-4k.mp4" download="Northstar-4K-Animation.mp4">Download 4K Master Film ↗</a>
      <a class="soft-link" asp-page="/Index">Watch on Home Page ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="film-story-visual">
    <img src="/media/northstar-story-poster.jpg" alt="Frame preview of the 30-second Northstar commercial" loading="lazy" />
    <span class="film-tag">3840 × 2160 ULTRA HD</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Manifesto Quote Banner -->
<section class="manifesto-quote" data-reveal>
  <div class="quote-content">
    <span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
    <blockquote>
      Commerce isn't just numbers in a database or boxes on a truck — it is the warm cup of coffee in someone's hands and the fresh morning staples that bring communities together.
    </blockquote>
    <cite>— Mikky Bloom Creative Studio & The Northstar Engineering Team</cite>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="bottom-callout">
  <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
  <div>
    <h2>Ready for your next good thing?</h2>
    <p>Step inside the live catalog or ask Nova for personalized product recommendations.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="primary" asp-page="/Catalog">Explore the collection ↗</a>
</div>
